<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Nuevo horario de misas de junio a septiembre</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Lunes: 20:00 y 21:00 horas.</strong><br><strong>De martes a sábado: 11.00, 12.00, 13.00, 20.00 y 21.00 horas.</strong><br><strong>Domingos: 11.00, 12.00, 13.00, 20.00 y 21.00 horas.</strong></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Confesiones</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Lunes de 19.30 a 21.30 horas.</strong><br><strong>Martes a domingos de 10.30 a 13.30 y de 19.30 a 21.30 horas.</strong> </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.conventosantoangel.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/LRR0863-1024x683.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-1701"/></figure>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Horario del museo</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>De lunes a sábado de 11.00 a 13.00 horas.</strong><br>Para grupos contactar con el P. Juan Dobado.<br><strong>Tel: 954 22 86 75</strong></p>



<figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex"></figure>





<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.conventosantoangel.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/LRR1187-1024x683.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-1703"/></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>

